{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Fast Pira Trip 是一款以離線運作為核心的行程規劃工具，特別適合重視私隱、又不願花大量時間編排行程的旅客。用家只要輸入目的地、旅行日期、節奏與風格，即可自動整理出逐日安排與出發前準備清單。軟件現正限時免費，原價 US $0.99，所有資料只存放於本機，無需註冊帳號，亦不設訂閱或廣告。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-26.webp\">\n<h2>離線生成逐日行程</h2>\n<p>設定目的地、旅行日期、節奏與風格後，軟件即時生成完整每日行程，並列出出發前任務與行李清單。介面分為五個部分，可切換不同旅程、在地圖查看已儲存地點、對照日曆確認時間，並集中記錄支出、預訂與筆記。行程可匯出至系統日曆，無需註冊帳號即可使用。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-411-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-412-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-413-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-414-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-415-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-416-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Fast Pira Trip</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T12:42:40.114409+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":326,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T12:30:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T12:38:11.218694+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T12:38:11.218694+00:00","content_hash":"4fb1df0627d92285e8c02c64d7ae1dcf1185076c40c57ba777fc07d185cf929b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}